## 5. Textile Sourcing in Delhi NCR

Delhi NCR has an established textile and garment trading ecosystem.

Several markets serve different types of buyers.

### Lajpat Nagar

Known for its selection of designer fabrics, decorative textiles, embroidered materials and occasion-wear options.

### Chandni Chowk

A major destination for traditional clothing, decorative textiles, and wedding-related materials.

### Gandhi Nagar

An important garment trading market with a large network of wholesalers and manufacturing-related businesses.

