## 8. Building a Digital Fabric Lookbook

A structured digital lookbook can help organize sourcing research.

A useful entry might include:

**Fabric Name:** Embroidered Net

**Category:** Decorative Textile

**Texture:** Sheer base with surface embroidery

**Suitable For:** Lehenga overlays, gowns and dupattas

**Construction Notes:** Requires appropriate lining and careful seam finishing

**Sourcing Notes:** Confirm motif spacing, embroidery quality and usable width

This format can be repeated for different fabric categories.

