## 10. Final Thoughts

Fabric sourcing requires a balance of design knowledge, technical understanding and supplier evaluation.

The most suitable material is not necessarily the most expensive or visually elaborate.

It is the fabric that meets the garment's functional, aesthetic and construction requirements.

